# Git conventions

Follow the **seedu-git-standard** skill for every commit message and branch name.

Read `.github/skills/seedu-git-standard/SKILL.md` (or `.cursor/skills/seedu-git-standard/SKILL.md`) before writing a commit message or creating a branch. Do not commit or push unless the user explicitly asks.
